<title>USA: Fannie Mae adds $14 mln to REMIC 1997-23.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae adds $14 mln to REMIC 1997-23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it added $14 million to previously issued Real Estate Mortgage Conduit (REMIC) trust 1997-23.</p>
<p>The issue is backed by 30-year 7.0-percent mortgage-backed certificates and various REMIC tranches, the agency said.</p>
<p>It now totals $337 million, up from $323 million, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>It was issued via Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and has a settlement date of March 31.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
